{"articleNo":"2491","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=2491&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2010 전기 대학원(산업,교육 및 컨설팅) 신입생 학적부기재사항신고서 제출","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2010.04.02","hit":"12175","attachments":[{"name":"학적부기재사항신고서.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=2491&attachNo=2029"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment-->&nbsp;\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’돋움’\"><!--StartFragment-->&nbsp;\n</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\">\n</p><table style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"1\">\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.1pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"553\" bgcolor=\"#ffffcc\" height=\"76\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: ’돋움’\">2010 전기 대학원 (산업,교육 및 컨설팅대학원)</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: ’돋움’\">신입생 학적부기재사항신고서 제출</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table>\n<span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’한컴바탕’\"><br><!--StartFragment-->\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 109.3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -109.3pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 16pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-FAMILY: ’돋움’\"><!--StartFragment--><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;</font>\n</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 93.8pt; TEXT-INDENT: -93.8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 16pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\"># 신입생 제출서류</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\"> :</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\"> 2010. 4. 1(목) ~ 4. 30(금)</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #282828; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\">까지 </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #282828; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">대학원지원팀(글로벌관 412호)으로 제출</span></p>\n</span><p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 122.4pt; TEXT-INDENT: -122.4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 16pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’돋움’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 학적부 구비서류 : 학적부기재사항신고서(</span><span style=\"COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-FAMILY: ’돋움’\">별도첨부</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’돋움’\">), 사진(3×4) 1매, 주민등록등본 1부.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’돋움’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<!--StartFragment--> <span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’돋움’\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’돋움’\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’돋움’\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’돋움’\">\n</span></span></span></span></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 95.1pt; TEXT-INDENT: -95.1pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 16pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’돋움’\">&nbsp; 나. 학생증 발급방법 :&nbsp;&nbsp;학적부기재사항신고서 제출→ 학적부 사진 등재 확인 → 원스톱서비스 ‘학생’→ ‘학생증 발급 조회 및 신청’→ 학생증 발급신청 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 85.1pt; TEXT-INDENT: -85.1pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 16pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’돋움’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 수령장소(학생증발급 요청시 수령장소 지정)</span></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’돋움’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;1) 학사서비스센터(학생회관 1층)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’돋움’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2) 각 종합학사행정실(각 학부건물 1층)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’돋움’\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’돋움’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;※ </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’돋움’; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">학생증 발급 신청일로부터 약 2주후 수령가능함</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’돋움’\">.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: ’돋움’\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: ’돋움’\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: ’돋움’\">20</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: ’돋움’\">10. 4.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: ’돋움’\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: ’돋움’\">금오공과대학교 대학원(산업, 교육 및 컨설팅대학원)장</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><br><!--StartFragment-->&nbsp; </p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
